Windows adaptation: TrackpadProMax for Windows, 2026.
The Windows implementation adapts session recognition, zone classification,
profile precedence and radial-menu/tiling concepts. It replaces all macOS
framework integrations with .NET/WPF and Windows APIs. No Apple framework or
data layout is shipped by the Windows application.
